==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[police]] [[box]]|es}}

# {{label|en|chiefly|British|dated}} a [[telephone kiosk]] where members of the [[public]] may [[telephone]] the [[police]]; a few original boxes still exist in [[Britain]], but they do not operate. Currently, the city of [[Glasgow]] (Scotland) has new police boxes, which are not booths but computerised kiosks, that connect the caller to a police CCTV control room operator.
# a small community police station, a [[koban]].

